{"strongs": "H3667", "word": "כְּנַ֫עַן", "translit": "ke.na.an", "root": "כנע", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Canaan", "definition": "I. כְּנַ֫עַן 90 proper name, masculine and of a territory Canaan ( ᵐ5 Ξανααν , Phoenician כנען = Phoenicia ; Ξνα = כנע , Hecataeus, see Müller Fr.Hist.Gr.i,17 and others; Egyptian Ka-n-±-na WMM As.u.Europa,205 ff. ; Tel Amarna Kina—na, Kina——i , etc., Bez BM Tablets, 150 Wkl TA 39 ; etymology dubious GFM PAOS Oct. 1890. lxvii ff. ; see also GASm Geogr. 4 f. Buhl Geogr. § 42 ); — 1. as proper name, masculine , son of Ham Gen 9:18 ; Gen 9:22 ; Gen 9:25 ; Gen 9:27 ; Gen 10:15 (as ancestor of Canaanites and Phoenicians; all J ); Gen 10:6 ( P ); 1Chr 1:8 ; 1Chr 1:13 (from Gen 10:6 ; Gen 10:15 ). 2. a. land, west of Jordan , into which Hebrews came, and where they settled, subduing the inhabitants; מַלְכֵי כְּנַעַן Judg 5:19 , ׳ מלך כ Judg 4:2 ; Judg 4:23 ; Judg 4:24 (twice in verse); hence ׳ מַמְלְכוֺת כ Ps 135:11 ׳ ישְׁבֵי כ Exod 15:15 (song in E ); compare ׳ מִלְחֲמוֺת כ Judg 3:1 ׳ עֲצַבֵּי כ Ps 106:38 idols of Canaan , i.e. of the former inhabitants; especially ׳ אֶרֶץ (ֿ) כ , ׳ אַרְצָה כ Gen 44:8 ; Gen 46:31 ; Gen 47:1 ; Gen 47:4 ; Gen 47:13 ; Gen 47:14 ; Gen 47:15 ; Gen 50:5 ; Gen 50:13 (all J ), Gen 35:6 ; Gen 42:5 ; Gen 42:7 ; Gen 42:13 ; Gen 42:29 ; Gen 42:32 ; Gen 45:17 ; Gen 45:25 ; Josh 24:3 (all E ), Gen 11:31 ; Gen 12:5 (twice in verse); Gen 13:12 (opposed to עָרֵי הַכִּכָּר v b ), Gen 16:3 ; Gen 17:8 (all P ) + 40 t. P , Judg 21:12 ; 1Chr 16:18 = Ps 105:11 also ׳ הָאָרֶץ כ Num 34:2 ( P ); ׳ בְּנוֺת כ Gen 28:1 daughters of Canaan = women of the land, so v Gen 28:6 v Gen 28:8 ; Gen 36:2 (all P ); כנען is personified Hos 12:8 = apostate Israel; ׳ שְׂפַת כ Isa 19:18 = the Hebrew language (without evil implication). \\ \\ b. the coast, especially Phoenicia Isa 23:11 compare אֶרֶץ פְּלִשְׁתִּים ׳ כ Zeph 2:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4093')\">BDB4093</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3667')\">H3667</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4092')\">BDB4092</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4094')\">BDB4094</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>כְּנַ֫עַן</bdbheb><sub>90</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> and <b>of a territory</b> <highlightword>Canaan</highlightword> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ξανααν</grk>, Phoenician <bdbheb>כנען</bdbheb> = <highlight>Phoenicia</highlight>; <grk>Ξνα</grk> = <bdbheb>כנע</bdbheb>, Hecataeus, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Müll')\">Müller<sup>Fr.Hist.Gr.i,17</sup></lookup> and others; Egyptian <transliteration><highlight>Ka-n-±-na</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('WMM')\">WMM<sup>As.u.Europa,205 ff.</sup></lookup>; Tel Amarna <transliteration><highlight>Kina—na, Kina——i</highlight></transliteration>, etc., <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bez')\">Bez<sup>BM Tablets, 150</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wkl')\">Wkl<sup>TA 39</sup></lookup>; etymology dubious <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup>PAOS Oct. 1890. lxvii ff.</sup></lookup>; see also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm<sup>Geogr. 4 f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. § 42</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> as <b>proper name, masculine</b>, <highlightword>son of Ham</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Gen 9:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,18)\">Gen 9:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 9:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,22)\">Gen 9:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 9:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,25)\">Gen 9:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 9:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,27)\">Gen 9:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 10:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,15)\">Gen 10:15</ref> (as ancestor of Canaanites and Phoenicians; all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); <ref ref=\"Gen 10:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,6)\">Gen 10:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:8\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,8)\">1Chr 1:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:13\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,13)\">1Chr 1:13</ref> (from <ref ref=\"Gen 10:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,6)\">Gen 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 10:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,15)\">Gen 10:15</ref>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> <highlightword>land, west of Jordan</highlightword>, into which Hebrews came, and where they settled, subduing the inhabitants; <bdbheb>מַלְכֵי כְּנַעַן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,19)\">Judg 5:19</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מלך כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 4:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,2)\">Judg 4:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:23\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,23)\">Judg 4:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:24\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,24)\">Judg 4:24</ref> (twice in verse); hence <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַמְלְכוֺת כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 135:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"135\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"135\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,135,11)\">Ps 135:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ישְׁבֵי כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,15)\">Exod 15:15</ref> (song in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִלְחֲמוֺת כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 3:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,1)\">Judg 3:1</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֲצַבֵּי כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 106:38\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(19,106,38)\">Ps 106:38</ref> <highlight>idols of Canaan</highlight>, i.e. of the former inhabitants; especially <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶרֶץ (ֿ) כ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַרְצָה כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 44:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,44,8)\">Gen 44:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 46:31\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,31)\">Gen 46:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,1)\">Gen 47:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,4)\">Gen 47:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,13)\">Gen 47:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,14)\">Gen 47:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 47:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,15)\">Gen 47:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,5)\">Gen 50:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 50:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,13)\">Gen 50:13</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Gen 35:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,6)\">Gen 35:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 42:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,5)\">Gen 42:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 42:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,7)\